SUMMARY (non-binding): Ferryman is free for any non-production use. It is free in
production for up to two (2) Seats, on up to two (2) Computers and up to two (2)
Mobile Devices. You may run as many Agents as you like on each Computer at no
charge; Agents are never Seats. Free production use requires registering a
contact email address. Using it in production beyond those limits requires a
paid, per-Seat commercial license from the Licensor. The full, binding terms are
below.

CHANGES FROM VERSION 1.1: the "four (4) Devices" allowance is replaced with the
more precise "two (2) Computers and two (2) Mobile Devices"; "Agent" is defined
and confirmed to be unlimited per Computer; and free production use now requires
registering a contact email address (Section 3). Anyone who obtained the Software
under Version 1.0 or 1.1 may continue to rely on that version for that copy; this
version applies to copies obtained under it.

